<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>AI on AI驱动数字化转型</title><link>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/tags/ai/</link><description>Recent content in AI on AI驱动数字化转型</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/tags/ai/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>一篇关于递归式改变记忆的论文，教会了我的三体怎么长记性</title><link>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/09/%E4%B8%80%E7%AF%87%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8E%E9%80%92%E5%BD%92%E5%BC%8F%E6%94%B9%E5%8F%98%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%BA%E6%96%87%E6%95%99%E4%BC%9A%E4%BA%86%E6%88%91%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%89%E4%BD%93%E6%80%8E%E4%B9%88%E9%95%BF%E8%AE%B0%E6%80%A7/</link><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/09/%E4%B8%80%E7%AF%87%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8E%E9%80%92%E5%BD%92%E5%BC%8F%E6%94%B9%E5%8F%98%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%BA%E6%96%87%E6%95%99%E4%BC%9A%E4%BA%86%E6%88%91%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%89%E4%BD%93%E6%80%8E%E4%B9%88%E9%95%BF%E8%AE%B0%E6%80%A7/</guid><description>把论文里&amp;quot;记忆会自己进化&amp;quot;的思想落到我的三体上：智能体以同样的方式失败两次，不是能力问题，是记忆问题。让三个智能体框架的共同记忆从&amp;quot;存得下&amp;quot;，进化成&amp;quot;会自己改自己&amp;quot;。</description></item><item><title>给厂里种个会记事的AI，一年比一年懂你</title><link>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/%E7%BB%99%E5%8E%82%E9%87%8C%E7%A7%8D%E4%B8%AA%E4%BC%9A%E8%AE%B0%E4%BA%8B%E7%9A%84ai%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B4%E6%AF%94%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B4%E6%87%82%E4%BD%A0/</link><pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/%E7%BB%99%E5%8E%82%E9%87%8C%E7%A7%8D%E4%B8%AA%E4%BC%9A%E8%AE%B0%E4%BA%8B%E7%9A%84ai%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B4%E6%AF%94%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B4%E6%87%82%E4%BD%A0/</guid><description>中小企业上 AI 绕不开一个尴尬：通用大模型很聪明，可它不懂你的厂，工艺数据又是核心竞争力不敢出门。中小企业需要的不是无所不知的通用 AI，而是一个懂自己、记得住自己、还一年比一年懂自己的 AI。本文是一条完整方法论：本体打底、数据锁厂、垂类调优、多源检索、记忆加迭代、工程化支撑、FDE 落地。</description></item><item><title>OpenAI 这脚刹车，把AI踩进了下半场</title><link>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/openai-%E8%BF%99%E8%84%9A%E5%88%B9%E8%BD%A6%E6%8A%8Aai%E8%B8%A9%E8%BF%9B%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%8B%E5%8D%8A%E5%9C%BA/</link><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/openai-%E8%BF%99%E8%84%9A%E5%88%B9%E8%BD%A6%E6%8A%8Aai%E8%B8%A9%E8%BF%9B%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%8B%E5%8D%8A%E5%9C%BA/</guid><description>Anthropic 用不到一年把年化营收从 90 亿做到 650 亿美元、头一回录得正利润，OpenAI 却同一天宣布暂缓前沿模型训练。一脚油门一脚刹车，把 AI 下半场的真相踩了出来：安全从成本变入场券，商业模式从卖对话换成卖工作流，资本从买想象变成买回本。</description></item><item><title>你觉得AI记不住东西是个问题？真正的麻烦是它忘不掉、改不动</title><link>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/%E4%BD%A0%E8%A7%89%E5%BE%97ai%E8%AE%B0%E4%B8%8D%E4%BD%8F%E4%B8%9C%E8%A5%BF%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%AA%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E9%BA%BB%E7%83%A6%E6%98%AF%E5%AE%83%E5%BF%98%E4%B8%8D%E6%8E%89%E6%94%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%A8/</link><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/%E4%BD%A0%E8%A7%89%E5%BE%97ai%E8%AE%B0%E4%B8%8D%E4%BD%8F%E4%B8%9C%E8%A5%BF%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%AA%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E9%BA%BB%E7%83%A6%E6%98%AF%E5%AE%83%E5%BF%98%E4%B8%8D%E6%8E%89%E6%94%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%A8/</guid><description>AI真正难的不是记不住，而是记住之后改不动、改了带崩一片、连旧的也忘了。记忆的本质不是存储，是把经验压成能改变未来行为的更新方向。</description></item></channel></rss>